'''Shaper's Presence''' is a temporary [[aura]] granted by {{il|Solstice Vigil}}.

==Mechanics==
Shaper's Presence causes effects on you and nearby allies to have a 20% slower [[Expiration rate]]. This modifier is additive with [[temporal chains]] and capped at 75%.

Shaper's Presence alone effectively increases the duration of all effects (positive and negative) by 25%.

